#: ../../AIDE/About/LFOM.rst:21
msgid "Linear Flow Orifice Meter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/LFOM.rst:21
msgid "The Linear Flow Orifice Meter measures the flow of water through the plant and creates a linear relationship between plant flow rate and the depth of water in the entrance tank."
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/LFOM.rst:31
msgid "Location of the Linear Flow Orifice Meter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/LFOM.rst:31
msgid "The Linear Flow Orifice Meter (outlined in red) is located in the entrance tank."
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/LFOM.rst:34
msgid "Generate New Models of the Linear Flow Orifice Meter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../AIDE/About/LFOM.rst:36
msgid "Edit the configurations to create new models of the Linear Flow Orifice Meter. Send us `feedback to share how you are using the LFOM model, to give us suggestions for how to make these models easier to use, and to <https://forms.gle/cqDPapYkcSmLnDu4A>`_  |reportabug|."
msgstr ""

